OL,3,GNEWSAStage set for #10m Derby Theatre
OL,4,Aexpansion plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby Theatre has been granted planning
OL,7,Fpermission for a multi-million pound
OL,8,Fexpansion project, paving the way for
OL,9,Fthe next act in the venue's
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FThe venue, based in the city's Derbion
OL,13,Fshopping centre, will see an expanded
OL,14,Ftheatre, a new purpose-built studio
OL,15,Ftheatre and new community spaces.
OL,17,FThe development forms part of Derby
OL,18,FTheatre's wider capital transformation
OL,19,Fprogramme, following the award of #10
OL,20,Fmillion in UK Government funding in
OL,21,F2023, with the ambitious plans now set
OL,22,Fto take centre stage.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
