OL,3,GNEWSAStage set for #10m Derby Theatre
OL,4,Aexpansion plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Brigham, CEO and artistic
OL,7,Fdirector at Derby Theatre, said: "This
OL,8,Fis an exciting step forward that will
OL,9,Ftransform what we can offer audiences,
OL,10,Fartists, learners and participants."
